      <PrimaryExemptPurposeTxt>The organization focuses on making astrology accessible, credible, and sustainable. It celebrates astrology's diversity by creating excellent quality content available to the community, elevating standards of practice, and providing guidance for professional astrologers to sustain themselves financially. The organization cultivates heart-centered bonding and community connections.</PrimaryExemptPurposeTxt>
      <ProgramSrvcAccomplishmentGrp>
        <DescriptionProgramSrvcAccomTxt>During the reporting period, the organization hosted an annual retreat for 110 participants featuring multiple days of specialized learning workshops and professional development trainings. Additionally, the organization conducted a speaker series consisting of webinars, conferences, and similar educational events with diverse presenters covering topics in astrology. The organization also offered immersion workshops that engaged approximately 100 unique participants. These educational offerings provided valuable knowledge and skills that complemented certification requirements administered by an affiliated 501(c)(6) professional association. The combined programming offered networking opportunities and professional development that strengthened practitioners' expertise in the field.</DescriptionProgramSrvcAccomTxt>
